  "id": "autonomic-response",
  "term": "autonomic response",
  "definition": "An autonomic response is an automatic bodily reaction to a stimulus, seen in measures such as heart activity, breathing, blood pressure, and peripheral vascular resistance. In this source, it refers to short- and longer-term cardio-respiratory changes that occur in response to a painful stimulus.",
